Keeps assets/images/ in the repository.

pubspec.yaml declares this directory, and Flutter errors with "unable to
find directory entry in pubspec.yaml" when it is absent — which a fresh
clone would hit, because git does not track empty directories.

Mascot artwork goes here. Transparent background, please: these are
drawn over light-green and white surfaces, so any baked-in backdrop
shows as a rectangle.

  lingoquest_parrot.png            the base pose. Supplying only this
                                   one dresses the entire app.
  lingoquest_parrot_celebrate.png  wings spread — wins and rewards
  lingoquest_parrot_curious.png    head tilted — "here is what's next"
  lingoquest_parrot_sad.png        at the desk — a failed attempt
  lingoquest_parrot_hero.png       full pose — shown with the wordmark

Each pose falls back to the base file, and the base falls back to the
painted parrot in lingoquest_parrot.dart, so any subset works.
